# Absolute or workspace-relative path to the agent-eval output directory.
# The UI reads JSONL trace logs (traces.jsonl, structural-assertions.jsonl) +
# per-run JSON reports (three-layer-report.json, cost-summary.json, etc.)
# from this tree.
#
# Example layouts the loader understands:
#   $AGENT_EVAL_TRACES_DIR/seeds.json
#   $AGENT_EVAL_TRACES_DIR/<runDate>/traces.jsonl
#   $AGENT_EVAL_TRACES_DIR/<runDate>/three-layer-report.json
#   $AGENT_EVAL_TRACES_DIR/<runDate>/cost-summary.json
#   $AGENT_EVAL_TRACES_DIR/<runDate>/structural-assertions.jsonl
AGENT_EVAL_TRACES_DIR=.evolve/agent-eval
